as one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. Steel, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}","text":"Steel and another Suit attempted to retrieve Eathon Lambert's journal. However he was no match for Sophie Casterwill. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. Steel, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. [The Casterwill Client]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, Steel was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]], although he also possesses a [[Slitherfang]] Titan.\n\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, Steel was issued with the standard Organization Titans, although he also possesses a Slitherfang Titan."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"*[[Augerfrost]]\n*[[Hyperstride]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n\n{{Col-2}}","text":"*Augerfrost\n*Hyperstride\n*Raypulse"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"*[[Mindrone]]\n*[[Redcap]]\n*[[Slitherfang]] ([[TCG:SAS-095|TCG]])\n*[[Strix]]\n{{Col-end}}","text":"*Mindrone\n*Redcap\n*Slitherfang (TCG)\n*Strix"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"185\">\nFile:Steel.png\nFile:Steel.jpg\nFile:Mr. Steel.jpg\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"File:Steel.png\nFile:Steel.jpg\nFile:Mr. Steel.jpg"}],"full_text":"Mr. Steel is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by DeFoe. He is one of the agents stationed in Venice, Italy.\n\n== History ==\nSteel and another Suit attempted to retrieve Eathon Lambert's journal. However he was no match for Sophie Casterwill. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. Steel, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. [The Casterwill Client]\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, Steel was issued with the standard Organization Titans, although he also possesses a Slitherfang Titan.\n\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n*Augerfrost\n*Hyperstride\n*Raypulse\n\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n*Mindrone\n*Redcap\n*Slitherfang (TCG)\n*Strix\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nFile:Steel.png\nFile:Steel.jpg\nFile:Mr. Steel.jpg","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n|image = File:Mr._Steel.jpg\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Venice, Italy]]<br>[[Prague, Czech Republic]]\n|gender = Male\n|hair = Grey\n|eyes = Brown\n|first = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"}}\n\n'''Mr. Steel''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[DeFoe]]. He is one of the agents stationed in [[Venice, Italy]].\n\n== History ==\nSteel and [[Unnamed Suit 002|another Suit]] attempted to retrieve [[Eathon Lambert's journal]]. However he was no match for [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. Steel, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, Steel was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]], although he also possesses a [[Slitherfang]] Titan.\n\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n*[[Augerfrost]]\n*[[Hyperstride]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n\n{{Col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n*[[Mindrone]]\n*[[Redcap]]\n*[[Slitherfang]] ([[TCG:SAS-095|TCG]])\n*[[Strix]]\n{{Col-end}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"185\">\nFile:Steel.png\nFile:Steel.jpg\nFile:Mr. Steel.jpg\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Italy"},{"target_title":"Prague, Czech Republic","label":"Prague, Czech Republic","target_id":"huntik:page:8072","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague%2C_Czech_Republic","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Prague%2C%20Czech%20Republic"},{"target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_id":"huntik:page:2257","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"},{"target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_id":"huntik:page:2048","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Ita